    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwezo wa Mwenyezi Mlungu kala u dzulu yangu, Roho wa Mwenyezi Mlungu achinituluza kondze na achinireha kahi-kahi ya dete rokala ri tele mifupha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achinizungulusa chila phatu mo deteni, namo kala muna mifupha minji sana ya kuuma ngbwungbwungbwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiniuza, “Mwanadamu, mifupha hino inaweza kuishi tsona?” Nami nchijibu nchiamba, “Uwe Mwenyezi Mlungu macheyo, ndiwe umanyaye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho iye achiniamba, “Ilavire unabii yo mifupha, na uiambe, ‘Mwi kano za kuuma phundzani neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaiambira mifupha: Nindahenda muinjirwe ni pumuzi, namwi mundakala moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakutiyani kano, nihende nyama zikale dzulu yenu na kukufwinikani na ngozi, na kutiya pumuzi ndani yenu, namwi mundakala moyo, namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nálavya unabii dza nrivyolagizwa. Nriphokala nalavya unabii, gafula kpwahenda ngongolo-ngongolo, na yo mifupha ichiuyirana, mfupha na mfupha wanjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati nalola náona kano na nyama dzulu ya mifupha na ngozi ichiifwinika dzuluye, ela kala taina pumuzi ndani yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiniambira, “Lavira pumuzi unabii na uiambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Ndzo kula pembe zosi ne wedze uavuvurire pumuzi hinya ariokala akaolagbwa, ili auye kukala moyo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 11:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nálavya unabii dza arivyonilagiza, pumuzi ichiainjira, achiuya kukala moyo nao achiima; jeshi kulu sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achiniamba, “Mwanadamu, mifupha ihi ni atu osi a Iziraeli. Aho nkuamba, ‘Mifupha yehu yauma, na tahuna kuluphiro tsona, hukaolagbwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo lavya unabii, uaambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Ni phephi na kufwenula mbira zenu nikutuluzeni, mwi atu angu, nami ndakuuyizani tsi ya Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphofwenula mbira zenu na kukutuluzani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakutiyani Roho wangu namwi mundakala moyo nami ndakuhendani msagale kpwenye tsi yenu enye, ndipho mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. Nkaamba nami nkavihenda,’ ” Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami tsona achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwe mwanadamu, hala chigongo uchiandike, ‘Cha Juda na Aiziraeli anaoshirikiana naye.’ Chisha hala chigongo chanjina na uchiandike, ‘Chigongo cha Efuraimu ambacho ni chigongo cha Yusufu na Aiziraeli ayae osi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kavigbwire vyo vigongo viiri vikale avi ni chigongo chimwenga mwako mkpwononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aiziraeli ayao ndiphokuuza, ‘Go uhendago manaye nini?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Ndahala chigongo cha Yusufu na mbari zosi za Iziraeli zinazoshirikiana naye chiricho mkpwononi mwa Efuraimu, nchilundzanye na chigongo cha Juda vikale chigongo chimwenga mwangu mkpwononi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gbwiririra vyo vigongo uchivyoviandika mbere zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha uaambire, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Nami ni phephi na kureha atu a Iziraeli kula mataifa ganjina arigophiya, nami ndaakusanya kula chila phatu na niauyize kpwenye tsi yao enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaahenda akale taifa mwenga kahi ya yo tsi, dzulu ya myango ya Iziraeli, nao andatawalwa ni mfalume mmwenga. Taandakala mataifa mairi tsona wala taandaganyika falume mbiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taandadzitiya najisi tsona kpwa vizuka vyao vya kutsukiza wala kpwa mwengarapho ra makosa gao ganjina. Nindaativya na dambi zosi arizozihenda na niatakase. Ndipho andakala atu angu, nami ndakala Mlungu wao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
