              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 34:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nami ndaapha mfalume dza mtumishi wangu Daudi akale mfalume wao, nao osi andakala na mrisa mmwenga, nao andagbwira shariya zangu na kulunga malagizo gangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andasagala kpwenye tsi nriyomupha mtumishi wangu Jakobo, tsi ambayo akare enu asagala. Aho andakala kuko na ana aho na adzukulu aho hata kare na kare, naye mfalume dza mtumishi wangu Daudi, ndiye ndiyekala mkpwulu wao ta kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaika chilagane cha kuahakikishira usalama, nacho chindakala chilagane cha kudumu, nami nindaajaliya na kuaenjereza, na phatu phangu phatakatifu ndaphaika kahi yao ta kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.16"
